### Get My Borrow History
GET http://localhost:5000/api/borrows
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN


### Create Borrow
POST http://localhost:5000/api/borrows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN

{
  "bookId": "6afd42943f81ec7e1e259331",
